# Qwen3.6-35B-A3B MXFP4, 4 x MI455X, MLPerf Endpoints agentic: the 2026-11-24 settings, on top of agentic_20261101.env,
# agentic_20261107.env, agentic_20261119.env, agentic_20261120.env, agentic_20261121.env and agentic_20261123.env
# (README, 2026-11-24 section). Code: alizaidy/gfx1250-qwen-support plus the aiter MXFP8 GEMM RES_FAST, router/shared-expert
# scheduling, fused MoE stage 1+2 and grouped-MoE config changes, and the ATOM low-concurrency step cuts.
# Nothing here changes c256-c1024 except the c1024 rotation line below; the grouped-MoE CSV rows (bucket 16/32/512) apply
# wherever those row counts occur (bitwise tile choices).

# --- c1024 only (set by the point): 3D decode XCD rotation (bitwise; +0.6% in two 10-minute pairs) ---
#   AITER_UA3D_XCD_ROTATE=1

# --- c64 (set by the point; measured at c64 only, c32 / c128 untested): low-concurrency decode bundle ---
# All bitwise except ATOM_MTP_DRAFT_LMHEAD_STATS (draft-head sampling stats differ in the last bits; tokens identical).
# 10-minute runs +5.9% (1159.0 -> 1227.4, two runs each), MTP acceptance unchanged; official length 1176.1, accuracy 0.5609.
#   ATOM_FOLD_QKNORM_QKV_BF16_FP4PT=1 ATOM_FOLD_QKNORM_QKV_BF16_MAX_M=48 ATOM_MTP_DRAFT_LMHEAD_STATS=1 ATOM_HOSTNEXT_PINNED_NAT=1 ATOM_HOSTNEXT_FUSED_PROLOGUE=1 ATOM_HOSTFAST_TRITON_EXTRA=atom.model_ops.attentions.gdn_attn:_gdn_spec_decode_pad_kernel,atom.model_ops.fla_ops.replayssm:_replayssm_commit_kernel,atom.model_ops.attentions.early_meta:_early_meta_fix_kernel,atom.model_ops.attentions.early_meta:_early_gdn_accepted_kernel,atom.model_ops.attentions.early_meta:_early_prologue_kernel
#   ATOM_EMBED_NORM0_MX32=1 ATOM_FINAL_NORM_INTO_OUTPUT=1 ATOM_PRESENCE_FUSED_ANCHORS=1 ATOM_SPEC_RS_STAGE_CACHE=1 ATOM_PROLOGUE_PACKED_H2D=1 ATOM_PERSISTENT_VERDICT=1
#   AITER_GEMM_RES_FAST=1 AITER_ROUTER_SHARED_V2_LATE_WAIT=1 AITER_ROUTER_SHARED_V2_XCD_ORDER=1,3,2,4,6,5,0,7
#   AITER_MOE_FUSED12=1 AITER_MOE_FUSED12_CFG=${AITER_DIR:-/opt/qwen35/aiter}/aiter/configs/model_configs/qwen3_5_35b_a3b_moe_fused12_gfx1250.json
